                <h2 class="mt-2">
                    Chairperson's Message
                </h2>

                <p>
                    Dear residents and visitors,
                </p>

                <p>
                    It gives me great pleasure to welcome you
                    to the official website of Bishnu Rural
                    Municipality.
                </p>

                <p>
                    This platform has been developed to make
                    municipal information and public services
                    easily accessible to everyone.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We remain committed to transparency,
                    accountability, good governance and
                    sustainable development.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Together, with the active participation of
                    our citizens, we can build a prosperous and
                    inclusive municipality.
                </p>

                <p class="fw-bold mt-4">
                    Thank you.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

